 **Inputs and Outputs:**
-*   **Input:** $N$ RGB images $\{I_i\}_{i=1}^N$ of the same scene, where $I_i \in \mathbb{R}^{3 \times H \times W}$. Camera poses are not provided.
-*   **Output:** A set of 3D Gaussians $\mathcal{G}$ and camera poses $\{P_i\}_{i=1}^N$.
+*   **Input:** $N$ RGB images $\{I_i\}_{i=1}^N$ of the same scene, where $I_i \in \mathbb{R}^{3 \times H \times W}$ [S1]. Camera poses are not provided [S1].
+*   **Output:** A set of 3D Gaussians $\mathcal{G}$ and camera poses $\{P_i\}_{i=1}^N$ [S1].
 
